{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19227","headline":"奉和裴侍中将赴汉南留别座上诸公 · 刘禹锡","name":"奉和裴侍中将赴汉南留别座上诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金貂晓出凤池头，玉节前临南雍州。\n暂辍洪鑪观剑戟，还将大笔注春秋。\n管弦席上留高韵，山水途中入胜游。\n岘首风烟看未足，便应重拜富民侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19227.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19227","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}